  "solution": "Sắp xếp khối lượng của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> con chim theo thứ tự không giảm:<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>150</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>150</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>155</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>155</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>155</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>160</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>165</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>165</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>165</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>170</mn></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là số chẵn nên tứ phân vị thứ hai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>155</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>160</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>157</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất là trung vị của nửa số liệu bên trái <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>155</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>155</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>155</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>155</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ ba là trung vị của nửa số liệu bên phải <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>160</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>170</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>165</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mẫu số liệu có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> mốt là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>155</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>165</mn></semantics></math>.",
